  "hero.oneItemStill": "Abu ɗaya yana nan a buɗe kuma ana nuna shi a fili: <0>bitar lasisin lambar wasan da ta fito daga samfurin farko na GPL<\/0>.",
  "hero.orion81Completely": "<0>Orion-81 aiki ne da AI ya samar gaba ɗaya.<\/0> <1>Yadda aka yi shi<\/1>",
